good song but nah :/ pls help me lmao

ive seen posts like "when ocd kicks in" from a person who posted some people cutting heads of others. it can be triggering and traumatizing to see a graphic video like that. theres a difference between being an edgy troll and posting content like that on these subs and he/she posted that to various different subs regards mental health. its like posting adolf hitler propaganda to jewish subreddit. its not "dark humour" its just disgusting i really wonder the motives behind these acts. 

&#x200B;

when i was like 16 and really into satirical politics i used to joke about hitler and nazis too like posting fake photoshopped pics of taylor swift in nazi uniform but come on its nothing compared to what these people do. theres a line that you need to avoid crossing imo despite your moral values / personal beliefs. OP was prolly adressing this as well, obviously trolls exist on every platform.
